[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "[Gabby gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "♪ Take us to the Dollhouse ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "♪ Little by little"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Let's live in the meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "-♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "-♪ What's the big surprise? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "♪ Let's shrink right down and go inside ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Oh, hi! I'm playing dress-up with Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Okay, Floyd, what will it be?"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Bunny ears or a skunk hat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Hmm. Looks like"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "he's having a hard time deciding."
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "But I know how to help."
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "We can flip..."
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "a Kitty Coin."
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "I'll flip the coin,"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "and if it lands on heads,"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "Floyd will wear the bunny ears."
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "But if I flip it and it lands on tails,"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "he'll wear the skunk hat."
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "-Ready? Here we go."
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "-[drumroll playing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "text": "[gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "text": "Tails!"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "text": "That means Floyd gets to be... a skunk."
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "text": "Floyd makes a pretty cute skunk,"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "text": "don't you think?"
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "text": "[gasps] What's that, Floyd?"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "text": "You want to wear the bunny ears too?"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "text": "Okay, Floyd. As you wish."
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "text": "There you go."
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "text": "Wow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "text": "I've never seen a skunk-bunny before,"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "text": "but I definitely like it. [laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "text": "-Oh! You know what that sound means."
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "text": "It's time for a Dollhouse Delivery."
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "text": "Come on."
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "text": "Okay, let's see what our"
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "text": "Meow Meow Mailbox has for us today."
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "text": "[gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "text": "Our Kitty Cat Surprise Box"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "text": "has this really pretty rainbow on it."
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "text": "It looks so magical."
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "text": "Should we open it up"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "text": "and see what's inside?"
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "text": "We're doing it."
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "text": "It's a little fountain,"
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "text": "with a Peekaboo Kitty on top,"
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "text": "water inside."
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "text": "Oh. And it comes with a matching bag."
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "text": "Let's see what's in here."
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "text": "[gasps] Oh, wow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "text": "It's a teeny-tiny Kitty Coin."
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "text": "Hmm. So, we have a fountain and a coin."
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "text": "[gasps] I know what this is!"
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "text": "This is a Wishing Fountain."
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "text": "Hmm. Now, let's see. What to wish for?"
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "text": "[gasps] I've got it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "text": "We should wish for more coins."
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "text": "That way, we can make more wishes."
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "text": "I wish for more coins."
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "text": "-♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "text": "Look at all these coins! [gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "text": "We should take these into the Dollhouse"
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "text": "and share them with the Gabby Cats."
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "text": "Do you want to come into the Dollhouse"
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "text": "with us and see what everyone wishes for?"
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "text": "Cat-tastic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 86,
    "text": "It's time to get tiny."
  },
  {
    "index": 87,
    "text": "♪ A pinch on my left"
  },
  {
    "index": 88,
    "text": "Pinch, pinch on my right ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 89,
    "text": "♪ Grab Pandy's hand and hold on tight! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "text": "I'm over here, in the kitchen. Come on in."
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "text": "Welcome to the Dollhouse."
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "text": "I can't wait"
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "text": "to see everyone's wishes come true."
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "text": "What are you gonna wish for, Pandy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "text": "Do you see Pandy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "text": "Did someone wish for a hug attack?"
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "text": "[laughter]"
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "text": "That was a good one, Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "text": "Hey, speaking of wishes..."
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "text": "-What are you gonna wish for?"
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "text": "-[sighs] That's a tough one."
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "text": "I could wish for a new Pandy Pack,"
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "text": "or the world's biggest coconut,"
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "text": "or a pickle cream pie."
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "text": "There are so many good choices."
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "text": "I think I need"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "text": "a little more time to decide."
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "text": "Okay, Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "text": "We can let Cakey go first."
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "text": "Where is Cakey, anyway?"
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "text": "[Cakey sighs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "text": "Hello, Golden Sprinkle."
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "text": "[Pandy grunts]"
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "text": "Oh! Hey, everybody."
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "text": "-Hiya, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "text": "-What you doin'?"
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "text": "I was just reading my favorite story"
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "text": "about The Land of Cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "text": "Ooh! That looks like a good one."
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "text": "Oh, it is."
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "text": "It's about a magical place"
  },
  {
    "index": 123,
    "text": "where everything is made out of cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 124,
    "text": "-[in unison] Everything?"
  },
  {
    "index": 125,
    "text": "-Yep."
  },
  {
    "index": 126,
    "text": "And hidden somewhere in the Land is..."
  },
  {
    "index": 127,
    "text": "the Golden Sprinkle!"
  },
  {
    "index": 128,
    "text": "[gasps] Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 129,
    "text": "[Cakey] If you can find it"
  },
  {
    "index": 130,
    "text": "and answer the Spatula Dragon's riddle,"
  },
  {
    "index": 131,
    "text": "you get to keep the Golden Sprinkle."
  },
  {
    "index": 132,
    "text": "[sighs] I wish I could go there"
  },
  {
    "index": 133,
    "text": "and find that Golden Sprinkle."
  },
  {
    "index": 134,
    "text": "Well, Cakey,"
  },
  {
    "index": 135,
    "text": "today might just be your lucky day."
  },
  {
    "index": 136,
    "text": "Is that a Wishing Fountain?"
  },
  {
    "index": 137,
    "text": "Uh-huh."
  },
  {
    "index": 138,
    "text": "And we've got a coin for you"
  },
  {
    "index": 139,
    "text": "to make a wish right here."
  },
  {
    "index": 140,
    "text": "Give it a go, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 141,
    "text": "Oh, boy! Oh, boy! I'm so excited."
  },
  {
    "index": 142,
    "text": "I wish we could go to The Land of Cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 143,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 144,
    "text": "[gasping]"
  },
  {
    "index": 145,
    "text": "[gasps] My wish came true!"
  },
  {
    "index": 146,
    "text": "We're in..."
  },
  {
    "index": 147,
    "text": "The Land of Cake!"
  },
  {
    "index": 148,
    "text": "Wow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 149,
    "text": "-And everything here is made of cake?"
  },
  {
    "index": 150,
    "text": "-Uh-huh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 151,
    "text": "All right!"
  },
  {
    "index": 152,
    "text": "Whoa! Cakey wasn't kitten."
  },
  {
    "index": 153,
    "text": "[munches]"
  },
  {
    "index": 154,
    "text": "The trees are made of cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 155,
    "text": "So are the flowers."
  },
  {
    "index": 156,
    "text": "[munches]"
  },
  {
    "index": 157,
    "text": "Even the rocks?"
  },
  {
    "index": 158,
    "text": "[munches]"
  },
  {
    "index": 159,
    "text": "Mm! Yep. [gulps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 160,
    "text": "-Cakey, this place is paw-esome!"
  },
  {
    "index": 161,
    "text": "-Yeah."
  },
  {
    "index": 162,
    "text": "And I can't wait"
  },
  {
    "index": 163,
    "text": "to find that Golden Sprinkle."
  },
  {
    "index": 164,
    "text": "Will you help me look for it?"
  },
  {
    "index": 165,
    "text": "Great! Tell me when you see it."
  },
  {
    "index": 166,
    "text": "There it is! On top of that mountain!"
  },
  {
    "index": 167,
    "text": "It's the most beautiful thing"
  },
  {
    "index": 168,
    "text": "I've ever seen."
  },
  {
    "index": 169,
    "text": "It sure is."
  },
  {
    "index": 170,
    "text": "But it's going to be a long walk"
  },
  {
    "index": 171,
    "text": "to the top of that mountain."
  },
  {
    "index": 172,
    "text": "That's why we're gonna take the train."
  },
  {
    "index": 173,
    "text": "-[in unison] The train?"
  },
  {
    "index": 174,
    "text": "-[whistle blows]"
  },
  {
    "index": 175,
    "text": "[brakes hissing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 176,
    "text": "Wait. Don't tell me"
  },
  {
    "index": 177,
    "text": "the train is made of cake too!"
  },
  {
    "index": 178,
    "text": "Only one way to find out."
  },
  {
    "index": 179,
    "text": "[munches] Mm! It is!"
  },
  {
    "index": 180,
    "text": "[gulps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 181,
    "text": "All aboard the Cake Train."
  },
  {
    "index": 182,
    "text": "To the top of Cake Mountain."
  },
  {
    "index": 183,
    "text": "♪ Climb the cake, climb the cake ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 184,
    "text": "♪ Riding the Cake Train to the top ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 185,
    "text": "♪ Climb the cake, climb the cake ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 186,
    "text": "♪ Get the Golden Sprinkle up on top ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 187,
    "text": "♪ Climb the cake, climb the cake ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 188,
    "text": "♪ Check it out, we're in the sky ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 189,
    "text": "♪ Climb the cake, climb the cake ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 190,
    "text": "♪ I think I'll give this cloud a try ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 191,
    "text": "[munches] Mm! Fluffy! [gulps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 192,
    "text": "-[laughter]"
  },
  {
    "index": 193,
    "text": "-[whistle blows]"
  },
  {
    "index": 194,
    "text": "♪ Climb the cake, climb the cake ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 195,
    "text": "-♪ Whoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 196,
    "text": "-♪ All right! We're almost there ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 197,
    "text": "♪ Climb the cake, climb the cake ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 198,
    "text": "♪ We made it! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 199,
    "text": "[in unison] Whoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 200,
    "text": "Look! We made it to the Golden Sprinkle!"
  },
  {
    "index": 201,
    "text": "Keep your eye out for the Spatula Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 202,
    "text": "He guards the Golden Sprinkle."
  },
  {
    "index": 203,
    "text": "Spatula Dragon?"
  },
  {
    "index": 204,
    "text": "-Roar!"
  },
  {
    "index": 205,
    "text": "-[whimpers] Found him!"
  },
  {
    "index": 206,
    "text": "Hi, Spatula Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 207,
    "text": "I'm Cakey, and these are my friends."
  },
  {
    "index": 208,
    "text": "Congratulations!"
  },
  {
    "index": 209,
    "text": "You have found the Golden Sprinkle."
  },
  {
    "index": 210,
    "text": "And now it is all yours..."
  },
  {
    "index": 211,
    "text": "-[squeals, gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 212,
    "text": "-...if you can solve my cake riddle."
  },
  {
    "index": 213,
    "text": "Tell us your riddle,"
  },
  {
    "index": 214,
    "text": "oh, great Spatula Dragon,"
  },
  {
    "index": 215,
    "text": "and we shall solve it."
  },
  {
    "index": 216,
    "text": "Very well. Ahem!"
  },
  {
    "index": 217,
    "text": "\"This cake is fluffy but flat,"
  },
  {
    "index": 218,
    "text": "and stacked on a plate."
  },
  {
    "index": 219,
    "text": "Add butter and syrup,"
  },
  {
    "index": 220,
    "text": "and it sure tastes great."
  },
  {
    "index": 221,
    "text": "What is it?\""
  },
  {
    "index": 222,
    "text": "[Cakey] Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 223,
    "text": "Ooh! Ooh! I know!"
  },
  {
    "index": 224,
    "text": "Yes, Cakey?"
  },
  {
    "index": 225,
    "text": "Is it pancakes?"
  },
  {
    "index": 226,
    "text": "You got it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 227,
    "text": "[munches]"
  },
  {
    "index": 228,
    "text": "You solved my riddle, and now"
  },
  {
    "index": 229,
    "text": "the Golden Sprinkle is yours!"
  },
  {
    "index": 230,
    "text": "[squeals]"
  },
  {
    "index": 231,
    "text": "Sprinkle party!"
  },
  {
    "index": 232,
    "text": "Cakey got his Golden Sprinkle."
  },
  {
    "index": 233,
    "text": "And just in time."
  },
  {
    "index": 234,
    "text": "Looks like the wish is wearing off."
  },
  {
    "index": 235,
    "text": "Bye, Spatula Dragon."
  },
  {
    "index": 236,
    "text": "Thanks for the Sprinkle."
  },
  {
    "index": 237,
    "text": "Spatu-later."
  },
  {
    "index": 238,
    "text": "I can't believe I got the Golden Sprinkle!"
  },
  {
    "index": 239,
    "text": "Thanks so much"
  },
  {
    "index": 240,
    "text": "for making my wish come true."
  },
  {
    "index": 241,
    "text": "Aww! You're welcome, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 242,
    "text": "Hey, Gabby,"
  },
  {
    "index": 243,
    "text": "where should we go for the next wish?"
  },
  {
    "index": 244,
    "text": "[Gabby] Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 245,
    "text": "I bet MerCat could come up"
  },
  {
    "index": 246,
    "text": "with a whale of a wish."
  },
  {
    "index": 247,
    "text": "To the bathroom!"
  },
  {
    "index": 248,
    "text": "Enjoy your Sprinkle."
  },
  {
    "index": 249,
    "text": "Bye, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 250,
    "text": "[Cat-A-Vator bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 251,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 252,
    "text": "Okay, I think I've narrowed it down"
  },
  {
    "index": 253,
    "text": "to a pickle cream pie,"
  },
  {
    "index": 254,
    "text": "a pair of polka-dot pants,"
  },
  {
    "index": 255,
    "text": "or a tree that grows hot dogs."
  },
  {
    "index": 256,
    "text": "Those are all cat-tastic wishes, Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 257,
    "text": "I know. That's why I can't choose."
  },
  {
    "index": 258,
    "text": "I'm glad MerCat is going next. Wait."
  },
  {
    "index": 259,
    "text": "Where is MerCat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 260,
    "text": "Here I am."
  },
  {
    "index": 261,
    "text": "[giggles] I was just playing under the sea"
  },
  {
    "index": 262,
    "text": "with the Baby Narwhals."
  },
  {
    "index": 263,
    "text": "[Baby Narwhals chittering]"
  },
  {
    "index": 264,
    "text": "Oh, hi, Baby Narwhals."
  },
  {
    "index": 265,
    "text": "-[Baby Narwhals chittering]"
  },
  {
    "index": 266,
    "text": "-Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 267,
    "text": "[Pandy grunts]"
  },
  {
    "index": 268,
    "text": "Now they want to come play"
  },
  {
    "index": 269,
    "text": "in the bathroom."
  },
  {
    "index": 270,
    "text": "But since they have to stay underwater,"
  },
  {
    "index": 271,
    "text": "there's no way."
  },
  {
    "index": 272,
    "text": "[Baby Narwhal chitters]"
  },
  {
    "index": 273,
    "text": "I really wish you could, little ones."
  },
  {
    "index": 274,
    "text": "We just might have a way"
  },
  {
    "index": 275,
    "text": "to help you, MerCat."
  },
  {
    "index": 276,
    "text": "Shimmering sea scales!"
  },
  {
    "index": 277,
    "text": "Is that a Wishing Fountain?"
  },
  {
    "index": 278,
    "text": "Mm-hmm. And here's your coin."
  },
  {
    "index": 279,
    "text": "Now you can wish for whatever you want."
  },
  {
    "index": 280,
    "text": "I know just the thing."
  },
  {
    "index": 281,
    "text": "I wish the whole bathroom was underwater."
  },
  {
    "index": 282,
    "text": "[blows]"
  },
  {
    "index": 283,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 284,
    "text": "My wish came true!"
  },
  {
    "index": 285,
    "text": "[Baby Narwhals chittering]"
  },
  {
    "index": 286,
    "text": "-Now we can play any game you want."
  },
  {
    "index": 287,
    "text": "-[Baby Narwhals chittering]"
  },
  {
    "index": 288,
    "text": "Hey!"
  },
  {
    "index": 289,
    "text": "I'm gonna catch ya."
  },
  {
    "index": 290,
    "text": "[gasps] So fast!"
  },
  {
    "index": 291,
    "text": "Where you goin'? [gasps, giggles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 292,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 293,
    "text": "Where did they go?"
  },
  {
    "index": 294,
    "text": "Looks like"
  },
  {
    "index": 295,
    "text": "they want to play hide-and-seek."
  },
  {
    "index": 296,
    "text": "Well, it is their favorite game. [giggles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 297,
    "text": "Do you want to help us"
  },
  {
    "index": 298,
    "text": "find the Baby Narwhals?"
  },
  {
    "index": 299,
    "text": "Great! Ready or not, here we come."
  },
  {
    "index": 300,
    "text": "Tell me when you see a Baby Narwhal."
  },
  {
    "index": 301,
    "text": "-[chittering] Meow-meow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 302,
    "text": "-[MerCat gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 303,
    "text": "Behind the shell curtain! Ha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 304,
    "text": "Found you, you little cutie."
  },
  {
    "index": 305,
    "text": "Your turn, Gabby."
  },
  {
    "index": 306,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 307,
    "text": "Tell me when you see a Baby Narwhal."
  },
  {
    "index": 308,
    "text": "[porthole creaks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 309,
    "text": "In the porthole window?"
  },
  {
    "index": 310,
    "text": "[Baby Narwhal chitters]"
  },
  {
    "index": 311,
    "text": "Great finding."
  },
  {
    "index": 312,
    "text": "And great hiding, Baby Narwhal."
  },
  {
    "index": 313,
    "text": "Okay, Pandy, you're up."
  },
  {
    "index": 314,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 315,
    "text": "Let's find that last Baby Narwhal."
  },
  {
    "index": 316,
    "text": "Tell me when you see her."
  },
  {
    "index": 317,
    "text": "In the toilet?"
  },
  {
    "index": 318,
    "text": "-[Baby Narwhal chitters]"
  },
  {
    "index": 319,
    "text": "-[Pandy laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 320,
    "text": "-That was a good one."
  },
  {
    "index": 321,
    "text": "-[chitters]"
  },
  {
    "index": 322,
    "text": "I think this underwater-bathroom"
  },
  {
    "index": 323,
    "text": "hide-and-seek calls for a fishtail five."
  },
  {
    "index": 324,
    "text": "[Baby Narwhals chittering]"
  },
  {
    "index": 325,
    "text": "[tails slapping]"
  },
  {
    "index": 326,
    "text": "Oh! Looks like my wish is wearing off."
  },
  {
    "index": 327,
    "text": "[Baby Narwhals chittering]"
  },
  {
    "index": 328,
    "text": "Wowzers!"
  },
  {
    "index": 329,
    "text": "-That was quite the wish come true."
  },
  {
    "index": 330,
    "text": "-[chittering]"
  },
  {
    "index": 331,
    "text": "[giggles] Thank you"
  },
  {
    "index": 332,
    "text": "for sharing it with me."
  },
  {
    "index": 333,
    "text": "You're welcome, MerCat."
  },
  {
    "index": 334,
    "text": "I think we should"
  },
  {
    "index": 335,
    "text": "head on up to the craft room"
  },
  {
    "index": 336,
    "text": "and see what kind of crafty-riffic wish"
  },
  {
    "index": 337,
    "text": "Baby Box can come up with."
  },
  {
    "index": 338,
    "text": "Let's do it. Bye, MerCat."
  },
  {
    "index": 339,
    "text": "Bye, Baby Narwhals."
  },
  {
    "index": 340,
    "text": "[Baby Narwhals chittering]"
  },
  {
    "index": 341,
    "text": "[Cat-A-Vator bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 342,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 343,
    "text": "But then, if I wish for"
  },
  {
    "index": 344,
    "text": "a remote-controlled toothbrush,"
  },
  {
    "index": 345,
    "text": "I can't wish for a pickle cream pie."
  },
  {
    "index": 346,
    "text": "Who knew wishing could be so hard."
  },
  {
    "index": 347,
    "text": "Oh! Hey, everybody."
  },
  {
    "index": 348,
    "text": "Doodles and doodads! What's that?"
  },
  {
    "index": 349,
    "text": "It's a Wishing Fountain."
  },
  {
    "index": 350,
    "text": "[gasps] A Wishing Fountain?"
  },
  {
    "index": 351,
    "text": "Yep. All you need is a wish"
  },
  {
    "index": 352,
    "text": "and a Kitty Coin."
  },
  {
    "index": 353,
    "text": "-For me?"
  },
  {
    "index": 354,
    "text": "-What are you gonna wish for, Baby Box?"
  },
  {
    "index": 355,
    "text": "[Baby Box] Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 356,
    "text": "Ooh! I know!"
  },
  {
    "index": 357,
    "text": "I just finished coloring"
  },
  {
    "index": 358,
    "text": "the last page in my coloring book,"
  },
  {
    "index": 359,
    "text": "so I'm going to wish for"
  },
  {
    "index": 360,
    "text": "something else to color."
  },
  {
    "index": 361,
    "text": "Like another coloring book?"
  },
  {
    "index": 362,
    "text": "Nope. I'm thinking something bigger."
  },
  {
    "index": 363,
    "text": "Much bigger."
  },
  {
    "index": 364,
    "text": "I wish the whole craft room"
  },
  {
    "index": 365,
    "text": "was a coloring book."
  },
  {
    "index": 366,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 367,
    "text": "[Gabby gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 368,
    "text": "Check it out!"
  },
  {
    "index": 369,
    "text": "Baby Box's wish turned"
  },
  {
    "index": 370,
    "text": "the whole craft room into a coloring book."
  },
  {
    "index": 371,
    "text": "And we get to color it."
  },
  {
    "index": 372,
    "text": "Paw-esome!"
  },
  {
    "index": 373,
    "text": "But what are all the numbers for?"
  },
  {
    "index": 374,
    "text": "We're gonna color the room"
  },
  {
    "index": 375,
    "text": "in different patterns."
  },
  {
    "index": 376,
    "text": "Rainbow, polka dots, and zigzags."
  },
  {
    "index": 377,
    "text": "Cool!"
  },
  {
    "index": 378,
    "text": "Let's start with the stuff"
  },
  {
    "index": 379,
    "text": "that has a one on it."
  },
  {
    "index": 380,
    "text": "What pattern goes with the number one?"
  },
  {
    "index": 381,
    "text": "-Rainbow, yeah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 382,
    "text": "-[Baby Box] Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 383,
    "text": "Grab your rainbow crayon,"
  },
  {
    "index": 384,
    "text": "and let's get coloring."
  },
  {
    "index": 385,
    "text": "-Meow."
  },
  {
    "index": 386,
    "text": "-[laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 387,
    "text": "[yells]"
  },
  {
    "index": 388,
    "text": "[laughs] Whoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 389,
    "text": "Wow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 390,
    "text": "What do you think, Baby Box?"
  },
  {
    "index": 391,
    "text": "Rainbow-riffic! Let's keep going."
  },
  {
    "index": 392,
    "text": "Let's color everything"
  },
  {
    "index": 393,
    "text": "with the number two."
  },
  {
    "index": 394,
    "text": "What pattern goes with the number two?"
  },
  {
    "index": 395,
    "text": "Polka dots!"
  },
  {
    "index": 396,
    "text": "It's polka-dot time!"
  },
  {
    "index": 397,
    "text": "[Baby Box laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 398,
    "text": "Oh! [laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 399,
    "text": "Ooh! I've never seen so many polka dots."
  },
  {
    "index": 400,
    "text": "What's next, Gabby?"
  },
  {
    "index": 401,
    "text": "All we have left"
  },
  {
    "index": 402,
    "text": "are the number-three things."
  },
  {
    "index": 403,
    "text": "Zigzag!"
  },
  {
    "index": 404,
    "text": "And done!"
  },
  {
    "index": 405,
    "text": "Oh, my goodness!"
  },
  {
    "index": 406,
    "text": "It's even more colorful than I imagined."
  },
  {
    "index": 407,
    "text": "That was a great wish, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 408,
    "text": "Definitely"
  },
  {
    "index": 409,
    "text": "the most fun coloring I've ever had."
  },
  {
    "index": 410,
    "text": "Thanks for helping me"
  },
  {
    "index": 411,
    "text": "make my wish come true."
  },
  {
    "index": 412,
    "text": "Your wish is wearing off, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 413,
    "text": "Bye, coloring book room!"
  },
  {
    "index": 414,
    "text": "Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 415,
    "text": "We have two coins left."
  },
  {
    "index": 416,
    "text": "One for me, and one for..."
  },
  {
    "index": 417,
    "text": "-[gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 418,
    "text": "-The CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 419,
    "text": "[chuckling] Hey, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 420,
    "text": "Do you want to make a wish?"
  },
  {
    "index": 421,
    "text": "Of course I do!"
  },
  {
    "index": 422,
    "text": "Here you go, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 423,
    "text": "Wahoo-hoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 424,
    "text": "Now I can finally get my wish"
  },
  {
    "index": 425,
    "text": "to swing on the stars."
  },
  {
    "index": 426,
    "text": "-Oh? Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 427,
    "text": "-Stars?"
  },
  {
    "index": 428,
    "text": "What stars?"
  },
  {
    "index": 429,
    "text": "I'll show ya."
  },
  {
    "index": 430,
    "text": "Out there."
  },
  {
    "index": 431,
    "text": "[Gabby] On my planet mobile?"
  },
  {
    "index": 432,
    "text": "[CatRat] It's all so shiny."
  },
  {
    "index": 433,
    "text": "Shiny is so miney."
  },
  {
    "index": 434,
    "text": "Okay, CatRat. Wish away."
  },
  {
    "index": 435,
    "text": "I wish I could swing on the stars."
  },
  {
    "index": 436,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 437,
    "text": "[CatRat laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 438,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 439,
    "text": "Hey, Floyd! Look at me!"
  },
  {
    "index": 440,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 441,
    "text": "[laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 442,
    "text": "I'm swingin' on the stars!"
  },
  {
    "index": 443,
    "text": "♪ Ya-ba-ba, na-na-na-na ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 444,
    "text": "♪ Thanks to this wish of miney ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 445,
    "text": "♪ I'm swingin' on stars ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 446,
    "text": "♪ They're, oh, so shiny ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 447,
    "text": "♪ When I look in any direction ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 448,
    "text": "♪ Well, alls I see is"
  },
  {
    "index": 449,
    "text": "My starry reflection ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 450,
    "text": "♪ La, da-da-da-da ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 451,
    "text": "♪ Ba-da, doo-ba-dee ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 452,
    "text": "Aww! CatRat's having so much fun up there."
  },
  {
    "index": 453,
    "text": "He's living his dream."
  },
  {
    "index": 454,
    "text": "Go, CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 455,
    "text": "♪ Meow, now, everybody look at me ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 456,
    "text": "♪ I got the world by its tail ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 457,
    "text": "[Gabby] Uh-oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 458,
    "text": "CatRat's wish is wearing off!"
  },
  {
    "index": 459,
    "text": "♪ CatRat's swingin' on a star ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 460,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 461,
    "text": "Uh-oh."
  },
  {
    "index": 462,
    "text": "[screams]"
  },
  {
    "index": 463,
    "text": "[grunts]"
  },
  {
    "index": 464,
    "text": "Uh..."
  },
  {
    "index": 465,
    "text": "Need a little help up here!"
  },
  {
    "index": 466,
    "text": "Don't worry, CatRat! We're coming!"
  },
  {
    "index": 467,
    "text": "[yelling] Help!"
  },
  {
    "index": 468,
    "text": "Oh, sprinkles!"
  },
  {
    "index": 469,
    "text": "What's going on?"
  },
  {
    "index": 470,
    "text": "What are you doing up there, CatRat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 471,
    "text": "His wish wore off, and now he's stuck."
  },
  {
    "index": 472,
    "text": "Oh, my! That's not good."
  },
  {
    "index": 473,
    "text": "Hang on, CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 474,
    "text": "We're here!"
  },
  {
    "index": 475,
    "text": "I can't hold on much longer!"
  },
  {
    "index": 476,
    "text": "[whimpers]"
  },
  {
    "index": 477,
    "text": "We've got to figure out a way to save him."
  },
  {
    "index": 478,
    "text": "[gasps] I've got it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 479,
    "text": "I know what I'm gonna wish for."
  },
  {
    "index": 480,
    "text": "I wish for a giant, fluffy"
  },
  {
    "index": 481,
    "text": "pickle cream pie!"
  },
  {
    "index": 482,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 483,
    "text": "[screams]"
  },
  {
    "index": 484,
    "text": "[gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 485,
    "text": "[screaming continues]"
  },
  {
    "index": 486,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 487,
    "text": "[CatRat grunts] Hey, is that a pickle?"
  },
  {
    "index": 488,
    "text": "[chuckles, sighs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 489,
    "text": "CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 490,
    "text": "Are you okay?"
  },
  {
    "index": 491,
    "text": "Um..."
  },
  {
    "index": 492,
    "text": "Yeah. I'm okay!"
  },
  {
    "index": 493,
    "text": "Thanks to Pandy and his..."
  },
  {
    "index": 494,
    "text": "[munches, gulps] Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 495,
    "text": "...delicious wish."
  },
  {
    "index": 496,
    "text": "-Pickle cream pie?"
  },
  {
    "index": 497,
    "text": "-[munches] Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 498,
    "text": "Pandy, your wish saved CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 499,
    "text": "Then my wish definitely came true,"
  },
  {
    "index": 500,
    "text": "and we've got"
  },
  {
    "index": 501,
    "text": "enough pickle cream pie for everyone!"
  },
  {
    "index": 502,
    "text": "-Who wants a spoon?"
  },
  {
    "index": 503,
    "text": "-I do."
  },
  {
    "index": 504,
    "text": "-Oh, sure."
  },
  {
    "index": 505,
    "text": "-I do."
  },
  {
    "index": 506,
    "text": "Yum!"
  },
  {
    "index": 507,
    "text": "You know, I don't think I could have"
  },
  {
    "index": 508,
    "text": "wished for a better day in the Dollhouse."
  },
  {
    "index": 509,
    "text": "Are you ready for one more surprise?"
  },
  {
    "index": 510,
    "text": "[gong crashes]"
  },
  {
    "index": 511,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 512,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 513,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 514,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 515,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat"
  },
  {
    "index": 516,
    "text": "Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 517,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat of the Day! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 518,
    "text": "It's me, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 519,
    "text": "♪ I'm not very good at this ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 520,
    "text": "♪ But maybe with a little practice ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 521,
    "text": "♪ I could tell myself to relax ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 522,
    "text": "♪ It will be better next time I try ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 523,
    "text": "-♪ And even if I still can't do it ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 524,
    "text": "-♪ Yet! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 525,
    "text": "-♪ You know that I'm gonna stick to it ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 526,
    "text": "-♪ Yes! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 527,
    "text": "♪ It's all about going through it ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 528,
    "text": "♪ And I'm gonna tell you why ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 529,
    "text": "Whoa! [grunts]"
  },
  {
    "index": 530,
    "text": "Whoopsie!"
  },
  {
    "index": 531,
    "text": "♪ Whoopsies!"
  },
  {
    "index": 532,
    "text": "I made a mistake and it's okay ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 533,
    "text": "♪ It's okay! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 534,
    "text": "♪ Whoopsies are what it takes"
  },
  {
    "index": 535,
    "text": "To get better and better every day ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 536,
    "text": "♪ Whoopsies!"
  },
  {
    "index": 537,
    "text": "I made a mistake and it's okay ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 538,
    "text": "♪ It's okay! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 539,
    "text": "♪ Whoopsies help me ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 540,
    "text": "♪ Look, see, I'm better at this today ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 541,
    "text": "♪ Whoo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 542,
    "text": "♪ Whoopsies, whoopsies"
  },
  {
    "index": 543,
    "text": "Whoopsies, whoopsies ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 544,
    "text": "♪ I'm a little embarrassed ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 545,
    "text": "♪ When I look at my drawing"
  },
  {
    "index": 546,
    "text": "Compared to this ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 547,
    "text": "♪ I'm just not getting anywhere"
  },
  {
    "index": 548,
    "text": "With this ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 549,
    "text": "♪ It makes me want to hide ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 550,
    "text": "♪ Aww! Don't be embarrassed, don't hide ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 551,
    "text": "♪ You should have seen mine"
  },
  {
    "index": 552,
    "text": "The first time I tried ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 553,
    "text": "♪ It took a lot of whoopsies"
  },
  {
    "index": 554,
    "text": "To look this way ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 555,
    "text": "♪ No one's perfect on their first day ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 556,
    "text": "Whoopsie!"
  },
  {
    "index": 557,
    "text": "♪ Whoopsies!"
  },
  {
    "index": 558,
    "text": "I made a mistake and it's okay ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 559,
    "text": "♪ It's okay! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 560,
    "text": "♪ Whoopsies are what it takes"
  },
  {
    "index": 561,
    "text": "To get better and better every day ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 562,
    "text": "♪ Whoopsies, whoopsies"
  },
  {
    "index": 563,
    "text": "Whoopsies, whoopsies ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 564,
    "text": "♪ Well, what about this? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 565,
    "text": "♪ I want to jump rope"
  },
  {
    "index": 566,
    "text": "But, nope, I just can't do it ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 567,
    "text": "♪ Well, not yet ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 568,
    "text": "♪ Come on and practice with me"
  },
  {
    "index": 569,
    "text": "You'll see there's nothing to it ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 570,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 571,
    "text": "Whoopsie!"
  },
  {
    "index": 572,
    "text": "♪ Whoopsies!"
  },
  {
    "index": 573,
    "text": "I made a mistake and it's okay ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 574,
    "text": "♪ It's okay! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 575,
    "text": "♪ Whoopsies help me"
  },
  {
    "index": 576,
    "text": "Look, see, I'm better at this today ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 577,
    "text": "-Yeah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 578,
    "text": "-Whoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 579,
    "text": "Whoopsie! Wait. Was it \"yeah\" or \"whoo\"?"
  },
  {
    "index": 580,
    "text": "I think it was \"whoo.\""
  },
  {
    "index": 581,
    "text": "Okay. Say \"whoo\" with us."
  },
  {
    "index": 582,
    "text": "[in unison] Whoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 583,
    "text": "Better."
  },
  {
    "index": 584,
    "text": "Thanks for coming"
  },
  {
    "index": 585,
    "text": "into the Dollhouse today."
  },
  {
    "index": 586,
    "text": "It was everything I wished for and more."
  },
  {
    "index": 587,
    "text": "Come back next time, and we'll open up"
  },
  {
    "index": 588,
    "text": "another Dollhouse Surprise."
  },
  {
    "index": 589,
    "text": "Bye!"
  }
]